## Safe

@narrator{code="0010"}: A dial with a keypad beside it, retrofitted by someone who did not trust dials. Three digits.
@nell{code="0010" mono when="entry.hymnBoard.read"}: Three hymns on the board in the chapel. He was a churchgoer, the director. They always are.
::keypad{pad="officeSafe" resultKey="safe"}
<match on="scene.keypad.safe.entered">
  <when test="$ == @safeCode">
    @narrator{code="0020"}: The door swings. Inside: a stack of death certificates already signed, dates left blank, and a white plastic keycard on a lanyard marked GATE.
    ::give{item="keycard"}
    ::assert{solved(officeSafe)}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0030"}: Nothing. Behind the painting of the ward in summer, something taps on the plaster three times.
    ::fright
  </otherwise>
</match>
